  "description": "This policy setting prevents users from sharing the local drives on their client computers to Remote Desktop Servers that they access. Mapped drives appear in the session folder tree in Windows Explorer in the following format:\n\n\\\\TSClient\\<driveletter>$\n\nIf local drives are shared they are left vulnerable to intruders who want to exploit the data that is stored on them.\n\nThe recommended state for this setting is: Enabled.\n",
